## PR open: https://github.com/JKershaw/LinearViewer/pull/2435

**CI is green on the pushed head `783b7d01a1e150d0b8934785be946988329d1371`.** Run https://github.com/JKershaw/LinearViewer/actions/runs/43473015948: Unit tests, Unit tests (proxy, clock +400d), E2E shards 1 to 4, Secret scan, and CI success all pass. The branch is rebased onto main `904719353`.

**What it does.** `lib/run-trail.js` holds the one comment classifier and the one trail pass:
- `COMMENT_KINDS`, a frozen table read by `commentKindOf`;
- `readTrail`, which also returns the six fields piece 1 reads.

The box, the stop-at guard, the owner's Done check and the merge recorder all take their PRs from the one landing, with statuses keyed by PR URL. A census test fails on a comment-kind test written anywhere else.

**What it retires:**
- the classifier split across `run-ledger.js` and `recommendation-facts.js`;
- `isLandingEvidence`;
- the private notes-PR set in `auditAfterLandingCloseOut`;
- `landingPrUrls`'s own loop (it stays as a thin view);
- the box's PR list as a decider;
- the index coupling (`prIndex`, `mergedPrIndex`, array-aligned statuses);
- the ruling mark's second spelling;
- the plan-comment check's separate home.

It settles three Waiting entries: `landingPrUrls`, `deriveCloseOutState`'s two PR lists, and the area-read entry. Row 15 is rewritten as a stated limit.

**Behaviour changes, each pinned with its old behaviour in the tests and the PR body:**
- row 14 flips (an audit carries only its first citations);
- an agent note citing a new PR counts as work after review;
- a new `area-read` kind;
- a person's Done is no longer withheld by an abandoned PR outside the landing (plan-review note 3);
- the stop-at guard refuses `head-moved` on the landing's PR even when an older PR is cited;
- merges outside the landing are not recorded;
- a PR cited only by a Survey is not read;
- three readings changed by matching one kind per comment.

**Recount (measure 1):** `eb14b7fff..17faa83f4`, 19 landings, 10 read, no landing's status changed.
**Reconciliation grep:** 288 hits, 287 kept, 1 retired, 0 needing follow-up.

**For LIN-4460 (piece 1):** `deriveCloseOutState` and `closeOutSetsDone` now take statuses as a `Map` keyed by PR URL (an array throws), and `closeOutSetsDone` takes `prUrl`. Rebase onto this PR.

Merge and Done are left to review and close-out.
